### Read all users
GET http://localhost:3002/api/users

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3002/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Charlie",
    "email": "charlie@example.com",
    "password": "pass123"
}

### Update a user
PUT http://localhost:3002/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "1",
    "username": "Neeti",
    "email": "neeti@example.com",
    "password": "pass123"
  }

  ### DELETE a user
  DELETE http://localhost:3002/api/v1/users/1